---
// src/components/DiagramaFlujoGestion.astro
// Gráfica de flujo visual sutil, elegante y con puntos de color del ciclo de gestión
---

<div class="glass-card bg-white/85 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/70 rounded-3xl p-5 sm:p-7 shadow-lg space-y-6">
  
  <!-- Header con título y botones de exportación -->
  <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-slate-200/60 pb-5">
    <div class="space-y-1">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap">
        <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-wider bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-800 border border-blue-300/60">
          Diagrama de Flujo Oficial
        </span>
        <span class="text-slate-300 text-xs">•</span>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500">135,628 Gestiones Atendidas</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
        <i data-lucide="git-commit" class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600"></i>
        El Viaje de una Gestión: Ruta Troncal &amp; Bifurcaciones
      </h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        Visualización secuencial del trámite con puntos numerados, tiempos de ciclo reales y el desenlace de primera instancia vs. la encrucijada de subsanación.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Acciones Rápidas para la Presentación -->
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 shrink-0">
      <a 
        href="/diagrama_flujo_gestion.svg" 
        download="Diagrama_Flujo_Gestion_SAT.svg"
        class="px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold text-xs shadow-sm hover:shadow transition-all flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer"
        title="Descargar gráfico vectorial para PowerPoint o Keynote"
      >
        <i data-lucide="download" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
        <span>Descargar SVG para Slides</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- DIAGRAMA VISUAL INTERACTIVO CON NODOS Y CONECTORES -->
  <div class="relative overflow-x-auto pb-4 pt-2">
    <div class="min-w-[860px] flex items-center justify-between gap-3 relative">
      
      <!-- LÍNEA TRONCAL DE CONEXIÓN DE FONDO -->
      <div class="absolute top-[68px] left-[10%] right-[30%] h-0.5 bg-slate-200 -z-0"></div>

      <!-- PASO 1: INGRESO -->
      <div class="relative z-10 flex-1 max-w-[200px]">
        <div class="bg-white/90 border border-blue-200/80 rounded-2xl p-4 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition-all space-y-2.5 relative overflow-hidden group">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-white font-black text-xs flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs">1</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-800">Ingreso</span>
            </div>
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 animate-pulse"></span>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-extrabold text-slate-900">Ciudadano</h4>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 leading-tight mt-0.5">Carga NIT, CUI, foto DPI frente/dorso y video selfie.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-2 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] font-mono">
            <span class="text-slate-400">Total:</span>
            <span class="font-bold text-blue-700 bg-blue-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">135,628</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FLECHA 1 -> 2 -->
      <div class="shrink-0 text-slate-300 z-10">
        <i data-lucide="chevron-right" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
      </div>

      <!-- PASO 2: ESPERA EN BUZÓN -->
      <div class="relative z-10 flex-1 max-w-[200px]">
        <div class="bg-amber-50/70 border border-amber-200/90 rounded-2xl p-4 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition-all space-y-2.5 relative overflow-hidden group">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs">2</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-800">Espera</span>
            </div>
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500"></span>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-extrabold text-slate-900">Buzón Regional</h4>
            <div class="text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-base font-mono mt-0.5">9h 04m <span class="text-[10px] font-normal text-amber-700">hábiles</span></div>
            <p class="text-[10px] text-amber-900/80 leading-tight">98.2% del ciclo total del trámite transcurre aquí.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-2 border-t border-amber-200/60 flex items-center justify-between text-[10px]">
            <span class="text-amber-700 font-medium">Estado:</span>
            <span class="font-bold text-amber-900 uppercase">En Cola</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FLECHA 2 -> 3 -->
      <div class="shrink-0 text-slate-300 z-10">
        <i data-lucide="chevron-right" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
      </div>

      <!-- PASO 3: REVISIÓN HUMANA -->
      <div class="relative z-10 flex-1 max-w-[200px]">
        <div class="bg-white/90 border border-blue-200/80 rounded-2xl p-4 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition-all space-y-2.5 relative overflow-hidden group">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-white font-black text-xs flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs">3</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-800">Revisión</span>
            </div>
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500"></span>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-extrabold text-slate-900">Auditor Fiscal</h4>
            <div class="text-blue-700 font-extrabold text-base font-mono mt-0.5">1 a 3 <span class="text-[10px] font-normal text-blue-600">minutos</span></div>
            <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 leading-tight">Cotejo visual del DPI contra RENAP y video selfie.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-2 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] font-mono">
            <span class="text-slate-400">Equipo:</span>
            <span class="font-bold text-blue-700">161 Revisores</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- BIFURCACIÓN HACIA DESENLACES (PASO 4) -->
      <div class="relative z-10 flex-1 max-w-[240px] space-y-3">
        
        <!-- RAMA A: APROBADA 1er INTENTO (FTR) -->
        <div class="bg-emerald-50/90 border-2 border-emerald-300 rounded-2xl p-3 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition-all space-y-1.5 relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 text-white font-black text-[10px] flex items-center justify-center">✓</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-900">Aprobada (FTR)</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-black text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-200/70 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">62.2%</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between pt-0.5">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-950">84,406 Casos</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-emerald-700">Resolución directa</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- RAMA B: OBSERVADA / RECHAZADA -->
        <div class="bg-amber-50/90 border-2 border-amber-300 rounded-2xl p-3 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition-all space-y-2 relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-[10px] flex items-center justify-center">4</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-900">Observada</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-black text-amber-800 bg-amber-200/70 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">37.6%</span>
          </div>
          
          <div class="text-[10px] text-amber-900/90 leading-tight">
            <strong>51,027 casos</strong> (76.8% por DPI borroso o reflejo). Plazo de 72h.
          </div>

          <!-- SUB-RAMAS DE SUBSANACIÓN -->
          <div class="pt-1.5 border-t border-amber-200/80 grid grid-cols-2 gap-1.5 text-[9.5px]">
            <div class="bg-white/80 p-1.5 rounded-lg border border-emerald-200 text-emerald-800">
              <div class="font-bold flex items-center gap-1">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span> 46.7%
              </div>
              <div class="text-emerald-700 text-[9px]">Subsanada (23k)</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white/80 p-1.5 rounded-lg border border-rose-200 text-rose-800">
              <div class="font-bold flex items-center gap-1">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-rose-500"></span> 53.3%
              </div>
              <div class="text-rose-700 text-[9px]">Abandono 72h (27k)</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- CONCLUSIÓN AL PIE -->
  <div class="bg-slate-50/80 border border-slate-200/70 rounded-2xl p-3.5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs text-slate-600">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-600 shrink-0"></span>
      <span><strong>Conclusión Visual:</strong> La atención del auditor es sumamente rápida (1-3 min). El 98% del tiempo se consume en la cola del buzón y, al observarse un caso, más de la mitad se pierde por falta de rescate inmediato.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 shrink-0">
      Fuente: Auditoría Forense BI
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
